@AbySalto.Mid_HostAddress = https://localhost:7221
@email = test@example.com
@password = Password123!

### 1. registration — expect 200 OK (first time)
POST {{AbySalto.Mid_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 1.1 user info before logging in — expect 401 unauthorized
GET {{AbySalto.Mid_HostAddress}}/api/auth/manage/info
Accept: application/json

### 2. log in using cookie auth — expect 200 and Set-Cookie in headers
POST {{AbySalto.Mid_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login?useCookies=true
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. current user info — expect 200 with email (Visual Studio uses it's cookie jar)
GET {{AbySalto.Mid_HostAddress}}/api/auth/manage/info
Accept: application/json
# Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### 4. incorrect password — expect 401
POST {{AbySalto.Mid_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login?useCookies=true
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}
